Package: mint-arm-system
Version: 22.3.5
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Linux Mint ARM local build <mint-arm@localhost>
Depends: systemd-zram-generator
Recommends: spice-vdagent, qemu-guest-agent
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Linux Mint ARM64 system settings for virtual machines on Apple silicon
 Configuration for the unofficial arm64 build of Linux Mint 22.3:
  - compressed RAM swap (zram) and matching memory settings
  - a smaller systemd journal
  - Firefox from Mozilla's arm64 apt repository, with Linux Mint's Firefox defaults;
    it renders in software, because UTM's accelerated OpenGL (ANGLE, OpenGL 2.1) loses
    Firefox's text when Firefox draws with it
  - Ubuntu's snap-only Firefox, Thunderbird and Chromium packages are hidden, as
    Linux Mint hides snapd
  - Update Manager does not suggest Linux Mint mirrors, which carry no arm64 packages
  - Apple Rosetta for x86-64 Linux programs when the VM runs under Apple's
    Virtualization framework with Rosetta sharing enabled
